323	    /**
324	     * Emits the audit trail for a freshly created owner: the human-readable {@code AUDIT} line and the
325	     * structured {@link OwnerCreatedEvent}, in that order. Both carry the owner's current primary
326	     * identifier — the human line its {@code customerCode} and {@code membershipNumber}, the event the
327	     * value returned by {@link #primaryIdentifier} — so keeping the two emissions together in one place
328	     * lets the audit trail's view of the owner's identity change in a single spot. The event's {@code
329	     * seq} is bumped exactly once here, so every emitted event carries a strictly larger sequence number
330	     * than the create before it.
331	     *
332	     * @param owner    the freshly created and persisted owner, already stamped with its identity
333	     * @param ownerDto the owner's mapped DTO, the source of the derived {@code membershipLevel} and
334	     *                 {@code membershipNumber} carried on the audit trail
335	     */
