375	     * Rejects an owner whose {@code firstName}, {@code lastName}, {@code address}, {@code city} or
376	     * {@code telephone} is missing (null) or blank (empty or whitespace only). Bean Validation on
377	     * the request body already rejects null and empty values, but permits whitespace-only strings
378	     * for fields without a stricter pattern (e.g. {@code city}, {@code address}); this guard closes
379	     * that gap so every required field must carry a non-blank value.
380	     *
