571	     * Counts the existing owners (before this create) belonging to the given household, i.e. those
572	     * whose stored {@code householdId} equals the value derived for the owner being created. The
573	     * count reflects only owners already persisted at the time of the create, so the owner being
574	     * created is never included; callers add one to obtain the household size after this create.
575	     *
576	     * @param householdId the household identifier derived for the owner being created (see
577	     *                    {@link HouseholdNormalizer#toHouseholdId})
